# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Datasets and large binary artefacts
#
# These are excluded deliberately, for two reasons:
#   1. Licensing - the Apache License covers this source code, not the MNIST
#      or CIFAR-10 data, which carry their own terms (see NOTICE).
#   2. Size - the local working copy carries ~526 MB of these, including four
#      .npz result logs of 75-99 MB against GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
#
# Nothing is lost by excluding them: mnist_ann.py and resnet_vgg_hwat.py
# download MNIST and CIFAR-10 through torchvision on first run, and the
# weights and logs are regenerated by re-running the studies.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
out_log_*/
*.npz

# Simulation and GUI outputs (stratum_platform.py writes HTML reports)
*.html
profiles/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# PyInstaller (stratum_app.py is packaged as a windowed .exe)
*.manifest
*.spec

# Environments
.env
.venv
env/
venv/
ENV/

# Testing and type checking
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
